0..75 Comment "//! The crossed pairing joins no two terms that the symmetry does not join."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..156 Comment "//! The conversion pairs the two arguments of a commutative operation in the"
157..234 Comment "//! written order or crossed. That choice must not join two terms that differ"
235..307 Comment "//! in an argument. It must not join the two orders of an operation that"
308..331 Comment "//! states no symmetry."
332..335 Comment "//!"
336..414 Comment "//! The checker tries the two pairings and finds a difference in each one. For"
415..491 Comment "//! the chain, the rules hold no symmetry, so the checker tries one pairing."
492..495 Comment "//!"
496..512 Comment "//! - see: #8311"
